'''Cat Tengu''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during [[THE DYNAMITES (Gacha Event)|THE DYNAMITES]] and [[Colossus Busters (Gacha Event)|Colossus Busters]] events. It was added in [[Version 11.7 Update|Version 11.7]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 14.0 Update|Version 14.0]] improves health, knockback chance and strengthen activation threshold. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 15.7 Update|Version 15.7]].

